    {
      "id": "b3a741fda8e425c8efc1846737a236dc675473a9",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1204448395,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I rebased to latest master and fixed commit name and text.\n\nI changed the constructor of QMouseEvent from\n\n`QMouseEvent(Type type, const QPointF &localPos, Qt::MouseButton button,\n                Qt::MouseButtons buttons, Qt::KeyboardModifiers modifiers,\n                const QPointingDevice *device = QPointingDevice::primaryPointingDevice());`\n\nto\n\n`QMouseEvent(Type type, const QPointF &localPos, const QPointF &globalPos,\n                Qt::MouseButton button, Qt::MouseButtons buttons,\n                Qt::KeyboardModifiers modifiers,\n                const QPointingDevice *device = QPointingDevice::primaryPointingDevice());`, by adding `QCursor::pos()` as `globalPos` after `localPos`, which already exists since Qt [6.0](https://github.com/qt/qtbase/blob/6.0/src/gui/kernel/qevent.h#L236) and [5.3](https://github.com/qt/qtbase/blob/5.3/src/gui/kernel/qevent.h#L111).",
          "author": {
            "id": 8941336,
            "username": "PhDittmann",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Philipp Dittmann",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/8941336/avatar.png?v=1789459804",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/PhDittmann"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-12-11T20:49:41.853Z",
          "updated_at": "2022-12-11T20:50:22.148Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 193172214,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
