          "id": 1207842055,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Can you split the Qt deprecation fix into a separate MR?\n\nShouldn't the unused variable warnings be covered by [ws_assert](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/wsutil/ws_assert.h#L33)? Is there something else that needs to be done for Windows? Adding `_U_` to these variables will probably create other issues with clang and debug builds.",
