        {
          "id": 1229564902,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I wonder if adding `(void) variable;` to the function body would work, similar to [Q_UNUSED](https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtglobal.html#Q_UNUSED), e.g.\n\n    (void)arg_count;\n    ws_assert(arg_count == 1);\n\n@PhDittmann, what versions of Visual Studio and CMake are you using? I can't duplicate the issue here with Visual Studio Community 17.4.3 + CMake 3.25.0.",
